  "search_hits": [
    {
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "matches": [
        {
          "text": "Somasekharan Nair who initiated pioneering studies in this field. During the course of his field ",
          "bbox": [
            72.02400207519531,
            357.27801513671875,
            530.5960083007812,
            370.56201171875
          ],
          "font": "Times New Roman",
          "size": 12.0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 2,
      "matches": [
        {
          "text": "The author remembers with great affection and gratitude Professor Somasekharan Nair, ",
          "bbox": [
            108.0199966430664,
            72.10798645019531,
            531.219970703125,
            85.3919906616211
          ],
          "font": "Times New Roman",
          "size": 12.0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "matches": [
        {
          "text": "Aranadan  ",
          "bbox": [
            108.0199966430664,
            201.43960571289062,
            184.010009765625,
            219.10733032226562
          ],
          "font": "Times New Roman,Bold",
          "size": 15.960000038146973
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 8,
      "matches": [
        {
          "text": "Sankarankutty, D.",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            69.45655059814453,
            188.5556640625,
            80.725830078125
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 9,
      "matches": [
        {
          "text": "ARANADAN ",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            82.87185668945312,
            184.2515869140625,
            97.97259521484375
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
          "size": 15.100733757019043
        },
        {
          "text": "The Aranadan (",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            112.84857177734375,
            166.7091064453125,
            124.11785125732422
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": "aranaatan",
          "bbox": [
            166.8000030517578,
            112.84562683105469,
            213.94241333007812,
            124.11490631103516
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": "Aranaatan, arantan and eranaatan",
          "bbox": [
            197.52000427246094,
            125.56559753417969,
            360.3423767089844,
            136.8348846435547
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": "their name which may be connected to Eranadu of Malappuram district, which is belived to ",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            138.7685546875,
            520.6465454101562,
            150.03782653808594
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": "be their original homeland. The Aranadans used to inhabit parts of Wayanad district adjacent ",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            151.48858642578125,
            520.7222290039062,
            162.7578582763672
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": "to Nilambur area and Edakkara, Kavala-mukkatha, Aranadan kaya, Karulai, Eranad the ",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            164.6885986328125,
            520.5884399414062,
            175.95787048339844
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": "The speech of Aranadans show features of northern dialects of Malayalam as well as ",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            216.528564453125,
            478.4263916015625,
            227.79783630371094
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasalization of vowels is an important peculiarity of Aranadan. Eg: ",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            255.4085693359375,
            429.1952819824219,
            266.6778564453125
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": "Lenghtening of word medial vowels is another feature axhibited by Aranandan as well as ",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            307.2485656738281,
            498.5160217285156,
            318.5178527832031
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": "Aranadan ",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            346.3685607910156,
            140.09463500976562,
            357.6378479003906
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": "corresponding words in Aranadan. ",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            424.1285705566406,
            252.41464233398438,
            435.3978576660156
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": "Aranadan ",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            450.048583984375,
            140.09463500976562,
            461.31787109375
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": " change is another feature brought about by Kannada influence on Aranadan. ",
          "bbox": [
            114.4800033569336,
            514.8485717773438,
            464.0946350097656,
            526.1178588867188
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": "Aranadan ",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            540.7685546875,
            140.09463500976562,
            552.037841796875
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": " in Aranadan. ",
          "bbox": [
            251.27999877929688,
            605.568603515625,
            315.05462646484375,
            616.837890625
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": "Aranadan ",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            631.4885864257812,
            140.09463500976562,
            642.7578735351562
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": " in Aranadan. ",
          "bbox": [
            260.3999938964844,
            696.528564453125,
            323.93463134765625,
            707.7978515625
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 10,
      "matches": [
        {
          "text": "Aranadan ",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            82.36859130859375,
            140.09463500976562,
            93.63787078857422
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": "nouns, Aranadan employs ",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            264.048583984375,
            218.81434631347656,
            275.31787109375
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": "Deletion of some case suffixes is a notable feature of Aranadan speech. The dative suffix ",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            341.8085632324219,
            511.1507873535156,
            353.0778503417969
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": "The future tense suffix of Aranadan is ",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            484.60858154296875,
            271.6170959472656,
            495.87786865234375
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "matches": [
        {
          "text": "Aranadan speech also has some peculiar vocabulary items such as ",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            69.4085693359375,
            431.075439453125,
            80.67784881591797
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": "Usha",
          "bbox": [
            163.67999267578125,
            121.29657745361328,
            188.27996826171875,
            132.56585693359375
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": "Keralathile Aranadanmar",
          "bbox": [
            207.36000061035156,
            121.24565124511719,
            325.50732421875,
            132.5149383544922
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": " ( Aranadars of Kerala), Vijinana Kairali, ",
          "bbox": [
            325.44000244140625,
            121.24859619140625,
            520.6981811523438,
            132.5178680419922
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 13,
      "matches": [
        {
          "text": "aran",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            134.2056121826172,
            114.82928466796875,
            145.4748992919922
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 19,
      "matches": [
        {
          "text": ". Muralidharan (1988) considers this is an independent ",
          "bbox": [
            252.24000549316406,
            592.6085815429688,
            500.8265686035156,
            603.8778686523438
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 20,
      "matches": [
        {
          "text": "Muralidharan (1988) points out that in this language, the common pronominal termination –",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            692.2085571289062,
            517.54931640625,
            703.4778442382812
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 21,
      "matches": [
        {
          "text": "Muralidharan, R",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            523.5364990234375,
            181.16868591308594,
            534.8057861328125
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 33,
      "matches": [
        {
          "text": "Somasekharan Nair, P.",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            471.45654296875,
            205.1178436279297,
            482.725830078125
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 36,
      "matches": [
        {
          "text": "karannu ",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            237.88560485839844,
            134.09463500976562,
            249.15489196777344
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": "karanni",
          "bbox": [
            161.27999877929688,
            237.88560485839844,
            196.56988525390625,
            249.15489196777344
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumaran Vayaleri",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            406.89654541015625,
            185.05337524414062,
            418.16583251953125
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 37,
      "matches": [
        {
          "text": "The Aranandan and Nayadis are supposed to remain outside a sixty feet boundary from the ",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            181.72857666015625,
            506.53033447265625,
            192.9978485107422
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
          "size": 11.269278526306152
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 39,
      "matches": [
        {
          "text": "Somasekharan Nair,P.",
          "bbox": [
            93.5999984741211,
            173.37652587890625,
            202.49461364746094,
            184.64581298828125
          ],
          "font": "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
